      "subtitle": "Keyboard, trackpad, and control deck",
      "localizedDescription": "Use your iPhone as an additional keyboard, trackpad, and control deck for multiple computers over direct Bluetooth or an optional ESP32-S3 BLE-to-USB HID bridge. Includes English and Ukrainian input, Shortcuts for text and URLs, a full-screen keyboard, clipboard typing, hardware controls, code scanning, and multiple-host selection.",
